       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     CPOLOGFLG.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, INC - DAN RAUCH
      ***************************************************************
      **                     C P O L O G F L G
      ***************************************************************
      **
      ** THIS PROGRAM RETRIEVES PO UPDATE PGM LOGGING FLAG(LOGTIME)
      ** WHICH DETERMINES WHERE PO LOGGING TAKES PLACE:
      **
      ** LOGTIME = "X" - LOGGING HANDLED EXTERNALLY BY APP PGM
      **           "T" - LOGGING HANDLED BY TRIGGER PROGRAM
      ***************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************

      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   APRIL 01 2003      DAN RAUCH
      *   INITIAL AUTHOR   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   MONTH DD CCYY      XXXXXXXXXX
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
                                                                       *
      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *===============================================================
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA IS LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT PO-UPDPGM-FILE  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCS7400
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.


      *================================================================
       DATA DIVISION.
      *================================================================
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  PO-UPDPGM-FILE.
       01  PO-UPDPGM-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPCS7400.


      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY FILESTATUS  OF COPYLIB.

      *============================================================
      *===              L I N K A G E    S E C T I O N
      *============================================================
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-PROGRAM-NAME           PIC X(10).
       01  LS-LOGGING-FLAG           PIC X(01).

      *================================================================
      *===        P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N              ===
      *================================================================
       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING LS-PROGRAM-NAME  LS-LOGGING-FLAG.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN  INPUT  PO-UPDPGM-FILE.

           PERFORM 1000-MAIN-LOGIC    THRU 1000-EXIT.

           CLOSE        PO-UPDPGM-FILE.

       0000-PROGRAM-END.
           GOBACK.


      *****************************************************************
      ***  GET PROGRAM UPDATE RECORD FOR LOGGING FLAG
      *****************************************************************
       1000-MAIN-LOGIC.

           MOVE SPACE            TO LS-LOGGING-FLAG.

           PERFORM 9000-READK-PO-UPDPGM     THRU 9000-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               GO TO 1000-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE LOGTIME          TO LS-LOGGING-FLAG.

       1000-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY CPOLOG TRG FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READK-PO-UPDPGM.

           INITIALIZE PO-UPDPGM-REC.
           MOVE  LS-PROGRAM-NAME  TO PROGNAME.

           READ PO-UPDPGM-FILE
           END-READ.

       9000-READK-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***                  END OF SOURCE
      *****************************************************************
